  through this transition of having got to  serve President Obama and be in the  cabinet the president United States  January 20th turned in my badge get kind  of shoot out the door as President Trump  took over and I was very focused on our  politics and everything that's happened  as I should be but when your husband  gets in an accident it puts everything  in perspective and and to get the  balance right and try to emphasize your  kids and your spouse and sort of sowing  your own garden is every bit of court  it's the foundation also for having the  right kind of politics the book is done  so at least you can go publicize it and  then back to home yes balance will be  restored yeah basilar power thank you  very much we appreciate it the education  of an idealist is on sale Tuesday
 

